  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://github.com/DivineRPG/DivineRPG-Assets/blob/main/site%20media/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"header\" width=\"1002\" height=\"282\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://github.com/DivineRPG/DivineRPG-Assets/blob/main/site%20media/dimensions.png?raw=true\" alt=\"dimensions\" width=\"800\" height=\"220\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">DivineRPG 提供了多個維度的豐富內容供你探索。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">尋找隱藏其中的秘密</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://github.com/DivineRPG/DivineRPG-Assets/blob/main/site%20media/bosses.png?raw=true\" alt=\"bosses\" width=\"800\" height=\"220\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">DivineRPG 擁有許多首領等你挑戰。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">你能全部擊敗他們嗎？</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://github.com/DivineRPG/DivineRPG-Assets/blob/main/site%20media/npc.png?raw=true\" alt=\"npcs\" width=\"800\" height=\"220\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">並非 DivineRPG 中的所有生物都想殺你。有些生物想與你做交易。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://github.com/DivineRPG/DivineRPG-Assets/blob/main/site%20media/armory.png?raw=true\" alt=\"armory\" width=\"800\" height=\"220\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">DivineRPG 擁有许多全新的盔甲、工具和武器，每種都擁有獨特的特性。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">你會選擇哪一種？</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr />\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">📺 影片常見問題系列</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">我們已整理了一份實用的 YouTube 播放清單，用來解答常見問題並展示 DivineRPG 的實際功能。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLEdW8z1ET4BKT87EOIGn1CVUg95bI8tt_&amp;si=msjYE_qnYe8K5YeU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>▶ 點擊此處查看完整的 DivineRPG 常見問題播放清單</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: bold; color: #c0392b;\">⚠ 第 6 集專門展示了全新傳送門系統 &ndash; 千萬別錯過！</p>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CdgSHo6vG0A?si=Wabouo1ullUsbjJz\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: bold; color: #c0392b;\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/btdKcbs\"><img src=\"https://github.com/DivineRPG/DivineRPG-Assets/blob/main/site%20media/discord.png?raw=true\" alt=\"discord\" width=\"1125\" height=\"158\" /></a></p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 1em 0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">如果你想加入我們的 Discord，只需點擊上方的橫幅。如果你對 DivineRPG 有任何問題，我們也有對應的頻道。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><del><a href=\"https://github.com/DivineRPG/DivineRPG-Assets/blob/main/credits.md\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://github.com/DivineRPG/DivineRPG-Assets/blob/main/site%20media/credits.png?raw=true\" alt=\"credits\" width=\"1002\" height=\"282\" /></a></del></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">點擊上方的圖片查看致謝名單</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
